with a sustainable focus" subtitle="OUR VISION"]Our experienced team of architects and designers, under the guidance of Facundo Taborda and Victoria Gauna, collaborate closely with clients to craft bespoke architectural designs. Whether it's a residential project, a dynamic commercial space, or an urban development project, we bring your vision to life. We believe in creative spaces and sustainability. TAM ATB's commitment to environmental sustainability is evident in their incorporation of green building techniques and energy-efficient systems.[/vc_headings][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width="stretch_row_content_no_spaces" desctop_mt="margin-lg-70t" tablets_mt="margin-sm-50t" css=".vc_custom_1699212587000{background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01) url(http://new.tamatb.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/tam-atb-architecture-services-scaled.jpg?id=3320) !important;*background-color: rgb(255,255,255) !important;}"][vc_column css=".vc_custom_1699211855442{background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.01) !important;*background-color: rgb(255,255,255) !important;}"][vc_wrapper subtitle="SERVICES" color_style="light" css=".vc_custom_1700632403657{background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.01) !important;background-position: 0 0 !important;background-repeat: repeat !important;*background-color: rgb(255,255,255) !important;}"][vc_projects_posts templates="services" post_type="services" total_columns="prague_count_col3" gap_columns="prague_gap_col15" posts_per_page="6" button_link_class="prague-services-link a-btn-2 creative" button_span_class="a-btn-line" button_style="creative"][/vc_wrapper][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>
