		<title><![CDATA[About Us]]></title>
		<link>http://new.tamatb.com/about-us/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 03 Jan 2017 15:30:07 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Tamatb]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://prague.foxthemes.me.1.2.0/?page_id=105</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[vc_row full_width="stretch_row_content_no_spaces"][vc_column][vc_banner_title color_style="light" subtitle="ABOUT US" title="TAM ATB Architecture" img="3194" enable_overlay="true" enable_fullheight="true" columns="%5B%7B%7D%5D"][/vc_banner_title][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row desctop_mt="margin-lg-40t" tablets_mt="margin-sm-70t"][vc_column width="2/3" desctop_mt="margin-lg-50t" tablets_mt="margin-sm-0t" offset="vc_col-lg-4 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-5 vc_col-sm-offset-2 vc_col-xs-12"][vc_team team_style="simple" image="3252"][/vc_column][vc_column tablets_mt="margin-sm-20t" offset="vc_col-lg-offset-1 vc_col-lg-7 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-7 vc_col-sm-offset-0 vc_col-xs-12"][vc_headings vertical_line="true" title="TAM ATB Architecture" heading_size="h2" subtitle="ABOUT US"]<strong>TAM ATB Arquitecture design studio</strong> has a professional experience of more than 40 years in the field of architecture and urban planning at national and international level. It has been led by the architects Angel Taborda and Victoria Gauna, with efficient and enthusiastic collaborators from different areas of the sector. Now, <strong>Victoria Gauna</strong> and <strong>Facundo Taborda</strong> continue to work together with a team of specialized collaborators.[/vc_headings][vc_column_text]Today, more than ever, it is evident that the construction of the habitat is a multidisciplinary objective, so we work with a team of architects, technical architects, builders, interior designers, designers, landscape designers, photographers and new technicians in areas that contemporary in each of our projects. All of them with an extensive experience in the sector.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=".vc_custom_1701719634466{padding-top: 20px !important;padding-bottom: 50px !important;}"]
<h6></h6>
<h6>WHAT WE DO</h6>
We design and build all kinds of projects: single-family homes, housing estates, commercial buildings, hotels, sports facilities, singular buildings, towers, exhibitions and ephemeral installations. We also dedicate ourselves to reforms, interior design projects and landscape design. We adapt to different budgets and we put all our experience and knowledge to the service of our clients.

&nbsp;
<h6>OUR PHILOSOPHY</h6>
For us, aesthetics and high quality design does not compete with functionality, but rather complements it, and also increases the value of the object and consequently the territory. The characteristics of the Costa del Sol, and especially Marbella - its topography, its landscape - suggest an emotional appropriation of the natural environment, but also human intervention is an expression of the landscape. For this reason, the concept of the overall design of the object is essential, including what we call the fifth façade: the roofs of the buildings. Singularities that are essential in our study.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]]]></content:encoded>
